{"unit_id":"tag:03RT:proof","translation":"若<MATH_0001>分离（separated），这立即由更精确的定理<REF_0001>得到。若<MATH_0002>非分离（nonseparated），选取仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0003>。对<MATH_0004>归纳，可以假定消没在<MATH_0005>上成立。于是 Mayer-Vietoris（引理<REF_0002>）给出\n<MATH_0006>\n。然而，由于<MATH_0007>为仿射概形（affine scheme）的开集（open），从而由维数（dimension）假设它仿射（affine），群（group）<MATH_0008>由定理<REF_0003>消没。\n","allowed_english":["Mayer-Vietoris"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"nonseparated","target_term":"非分离"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开集"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"nonseparated","target_term":"非分离","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开集","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群","context":"词表尚未批准"}],"notes":[]}
